    {
      "name": "arrangement-ordex-builds",
      "description": "The exact arrangement the gateway composes: two padding inputs, the offered output at index 2, funding behind it, and outputs that absorb padding plus the offered value ahead of the seller payment. The invariant holds with equality.",
